WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.789
Can you please clean up your stuff just for once?

1
00:00:03.619 --> 00:00:05.920
I'm always the one picking up after you.

2
00:00:06.929 --> 00:00:07.679
Relax,

3
00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:09.470
it's just a few things.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.119
It's not that big of a deal.

5
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:14.489
It's a big deal to me.

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.059
I can't live in this mess.

7
00:00:17.959 --> 00:00:21.770
Studies show that a cluttered environment can increase stress levels.

8
00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:24.100
I'm not lazy.

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.579
I just don't need everything to be perfect all the time like you do.

10
00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.879
Not everyone thrives in a tidy space.

11
00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:37.159
I get that,

12
00:00:37.319 --> 00:00:39.099
but think about how it impacts me.

13
00:00:39.909 --> 00:00:43.369
I shouldn't have to clean up every day just because of your habits.